.TH tkudavaccount n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkudavaccount
.PP
A DAV account form: fields for server URL, user, password and type (carddav/caldav/webdav), plus a \fBTest connection\fR button that runs a PROPFIND through \fBtclutils::tudav\fR and reports success or failure in a status line.
.PP
The test is synchronous (one PROPFIND); the UI is briefly blocked while it runs.
.SS API
.CS
set a [::tkutils::tkudavaccount::widget .a -type carddav \
        -command {apply {{ok msg} {puts [expr {$ok ? "connected" : $msg}]}}}]
::tkutils::tkudavaccount::setConfig $a {url https://h/c/ user alice password pw}
::tkutils::tkudavaccount::testConnection $a      ;# 1 on success, 0 on failure
.CE
.PP
Commands:
.IP \(bu
\fBwidget path ?\-url? ?\-user? ?\-password? ?\-type? ?\-command cmd?\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBgetConfig path\fR → dict \fB{url user password type}\fR ; \fBsetConfig path dict\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBclear path\fR ; \fBfocusUrl path\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBtestConnection path\fR — runs the PROPFIND; returns 1/0, updates the status line, and calls \fB\-command ok message\fR.
.PP
Requires \fBtclutils::tudav\fR (https pulls in the \fBtls\fR package on first use).
